Package: conduit-proxy
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: lopatnov <lopatnov@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: adduser
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/lopatnov/conduit
Description: High-performance reverse proxy and static file server
 Conduit is a reverse proxy, API gateway and static file server written in
 Rust on Cloudflare Pingora: TLS, JWT and other authentication, rate limiting,
 load balancing, caching, scripting and WebAssembly plugins, metrics and hot
 reload, configured from one YAML or JSON file.
 .
 This is the full build, a static binary that needs no other library. The
 service is installed but neither enabled nor started: edit
 /etc/conduit/conduit.yaml, check it with "conduit validate", then run
 "systemctl enable --now conduit".
